        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 4040-7, 7\" Single Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges plus #12 x 1-1/4\" wood  screws and 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws . Non-template screw hole pattern for use on metal or wood doors (ANSI K81011F).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer spring hinges are certified Grade 1 (highest grade) for 1 million cycles and made in the USA. For wood or metal doors 2\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 4040-7 7\" Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .114</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 2\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Factory Set Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified <b>Grade 1</b> for 1 million cycles.</li>\r\n<li><b>UL Listed For Fire Rated Door Applications</b> (\"A\" label openings)</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81011F</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4040-7.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 4040-7 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 4010 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 4040-7 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>4040-7</td>\r\n<td>130 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>175 lbs</td>\r\n<td>4'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>2\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\"><span class=\"text\">Bommer Hinges made in the USA</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 4010 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued.  <a href=\"/products/7-inch-single-acting-spring-hinge-pair-pbb-sa8170\">See available direct fit replacement PBB-SA8170</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
